  "note": "Two chords all the way: four bars of Emaj7, two of F#m, two of Emaj7, round and round. Count four slow beats with a gentle one-two-three inside each, and let every chord ring; one soft strum per beat is plenty. F#m is a full barre at fret 2. The tune and the slide guitar are left out.",
