  "remarks": "Several sources name the two chords, Emaj7 and F#m. Bar counts come from a bass transcription (53 bars, shuffle feel at 69) and match a solo-guitar arrangement and the 3:07 length. One lesson hears the E bars as A over E moving to Emaj7. Tempo sources give 67 to 72. Section names are only labels for the rounds.",
